# Build receipt for the self-hosted webfonts - records what public/fonts/ was
# built from, so a matching build is skipped. Deliberately NOT in public/, which
# vite copies wholesale into dist/ and web/embed.go bakes into the binary; a
# build receipt does not belong in a shipped artifact. See scripts/build-fonts.ts.
/.iosevka-build.json
